{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"セブンイレブンフェア開催中だよ！\nどのコーナー見ても乃木坂ちゃんなので\nわあ！ってなります〜\n納豆好きなので納豆おすすめです。\n乃木坂納豆。\n最近グミ好きだから、グミも。\nもれなくうちわがついてくる\nお菓子バッグにグミが入ってるよ！！！\nわあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー和定食食べたいなあ\nお味噌汁とごはんと魚と納豆食べたい気分ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/05/25/5872864/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/05/25/5872864/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッションたのしいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TVstation/TVLIFE/B.L.T.\nそれぞれ発売中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/05/25/5872864/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱海いいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/05/25/5872864/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻に入れたがりヽ(ﾟ､｡)ﾉヽ(ﾟ､｡)ﾉヽ(ﾟ､｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム発売告知を含め\n他にもいろいろ載る予定です。\n憧れの現場何度か目の体験ですが、\nこのうずっちゃう気持ちはいつまでも\n無くしちゃいけない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/05/25/5872864/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セカンドアルバム、\n『それぞれの椅子』\nよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}